ement that allows to present recommended or predictive options based on user’s input or context,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and is commonly used to capture filtering decisions.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Suggestion chip is typically non-selected by default and can be tapped or clicked to apply the suggestion, streamlining input and enhancing usability.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Chips can show multiple interactive elements together in the same area, such as a list of selectable movie times, or a serie of email contacts.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudssuggestionchip","kind":"symbol"},"ic_folder_categories.png":{"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","type":"image","alt":null,"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/ic_folder_categories.png"}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents":{"kind":"symbol","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents","role":"collection","type":"topic","title":"Components","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by OUDS. It contains also "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"text":" extensions and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifiers"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"Components"}]}}}